{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-10-71","kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：二项无理线段与中项无理线段与无理线段","englishTitle":"If a rational and a medial area be added together, four irrational straight lines arise, namely a binomial or a first bimedial or a major or a side of a rational plus a medial area.","book":10,"number":71,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.71","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.71/","group":"prop_2","sourceNumber":71,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-10-71@raw-ba8ecb9e6afbe458","contentId":"euclid-10-71","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ba8ecb9e6afbe4582988f4d6d3d47d4368a87e7dacf0f0136afdcbd9ec1852fc","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-10-71.statement","euclid-10-71.construction.1","euclid-10-71.proof.1","euclid-10-71.proof.2","euclid-10-71.proof.3","euclid-10-71.proof.4","euclid-10-71.proof.5","euclid-10-71.proof.6","euclid-10-71.proof.7","euclid-10-71.proof.8","euclid-10-71.proof.9","euclid-10-71.proof.10","euclid-10-71.proof.11","euclid-10-71.proof.12","euclid-10-71.proof.13","euclid-10-71.proof.14","euclid-10-71.proof.15","euclid-10-71.proof.16","euclid-10-71.proof.17","euclid-10-71.proof.18","euclid-10-71.proof.19","euclid-10-71.proof.20","euclid-10-71.proof.21","euclid-10-71.proof.22","euclid-10-71.proof.23","euclid-10-71.proof.24","euclid-10-71.proof.25","euclid-10-71.proof.26","euclid-10-71.proof.27","euclid-10-71.proof.28","euclid-10-71.conclusion","euclid-10-71.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-10-71.statement","contentId":"euclid-10-71","revisionId":"euclid-10-71@raw-ba8ecb9e6afbe458","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2aee7b2873ea968f595a5a95010eb81c8990f1ae4cd7e5cdb338c048a28dd8fe","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If a rational and a medial area be added together, four irrational straight lines arise, namely a binomial or a first bimedial or a major or a side of a rational plus a medial area."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果将有理和中项无理线段区域加在一起,则产生4 无理线段个区域,即二项无理线段或最初双中项无理线段个区域或有理加中项无理线段区域的一个大区域或一侧区域。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-71.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-10-71","revisionId":"euclid-10-71@raw-ba8ecb9e6afbe458","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d0b95d098d19eda4ecb477fbc4ffb43af8816241bc59077d79a17e7be778b80b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let. AB be rational, and CD medial; I say that the side of the area AD is a binomial or a first bimedial or a major or a side of a rational plus a medial area."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让我们来决定AB是有理,CD是中项无理线段;我说,AD区的一方是二项无理线段,或者最初的双中项无理线段,或者有理加中项无理线段区的一方是少校或一方。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-71.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-10-71","revisionId":"euclid-10-71@raw-ba8ecb9e6afbe458","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"23202ee9edb4dd77632dea248cfd01ab21324d0ed1551171149d59d388c022f2","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For AB is either greater or less than CD."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AB中,有的大于,有的少于CD。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-71.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-10-71","revisionId":"euclid-10-71@raw-ba8ecb9e6afbe458","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e05b54165d2ff354c846305085618703a1382226656b1c3b2f948c84100e3a42","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"First, let it be greater; let a rational straight line EF be set out, let there be applied to EF the rectangle EG equal to AB, producing EH as breadth, and let HI, equal to DC, be applied to EF, producing HK as breadth."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"首先,要扩大范围;先列出有理线段 EF,然后将矩形 EG等于AB,宽度扩大EH,HI等于DC,宽度扩大EF。（相关点与线段：HK）"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-71.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-10-71","revisionId":"euclid-10-71@raw-ba8ecb9e6afbe458","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"19bc5d46e6f5ff2db697f2b36c796c9aa7ed972baa429a581d94852fd9fd58d9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Then, since AB is rational and is equal to EG, therefore EG is also rational."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AB是有理,等于EG,因此EG也是有理。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-71.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-10-71","revisionId":"euclid-10-71@raw-ba8ecb9e6afbe458","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f5afd4c5be164f84939ca99eccb38b77f65c32ad4aa37a8a7e08451ada906859","citations":["euclid-10-20"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And it has been applied to EF, producing EH as breadth; therefore EH is rational and commensurable in length with EF. [[X. 20](/principles/euclid-10-20)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"其范围已扩大到EF,宽度扩大为EH;因此,EH是有理,长度可公度是EF。 [[X. 20](/principles/euclid-10-20)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-71.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-10-71","revisionId":"euclid-10-71@raw-ba8ecb9e6afbe458","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5d81ab3d2539c7ca9e70a10bcb80d5fb006a5232c69ab4ad5f0f439351141335","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Again, since CD is medial and is equal to HI, therefore HI is also medial."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,由于CD为中项无理线段,相当于HI,因此HI也是中项无理线段。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-71.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-10-71","revisionId":"euclid-10-71@raw-ba8ecb9e6afbe458","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"032e918f715c79b6939a8958a1040fa04c8eaaa965ac4d9363dacacdbccfc0c6","citations":["euclid-10-22"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And it is applied to the rational straight line EF, producing HK as breadth; therefore HK is rational and incommensurable in length with EF [[X. 22](/principles/euclid-10-22)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"适用于有理线段 EF,宽度扩大HK,因此HK为有理和不可公度,长EF [[X. 22](/principles/euclid-10-22)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-71.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-10-71","revisionId":"euclid-10-71@raw-ba8ecb9e6afbe458","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"66dc52ad50a718fca3f59951e69cf44b85bbc7d13624a7c48c10c00ae89391ae","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since CD is medial, while AB is rational, therefore AB is incommensurable with CD, so that EG is also incommensurable with HI."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"CD是中项无理线段,AB是有理,AB是不可公度,CD,CD,EG也是不可公度,HI。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-71.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-10-71","revisionId":"euclid-10-71@raw-ba8ecb9e6afbe458","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b9523bf3314d9e88981e0b70d55157cc7577b1d8192e7329d02b1a6126cb01ac","citations":["euclid-6-1","euclid-10-11"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, as EG is to HI, so is EH to HK; [[VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1)] therefore EH is also incommensurable in length with HK. [[X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,EG比HI的比等于EH比HK,因此,EH比EG,长度为HK；EG 与 HI 之比等于 EH 与 HK 之比；上述对应量不可公度。 [[VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1)] [[X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-71.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-10-71","revisionId":"euclid-10-71@raw-ba8ecb9e6afbe458","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f097b91062317346ff933190283eb00d2158f1bb364c4cb67e76a8abe631473b","citations":["euclid-10-36"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And both are rational; therefore EH, HK are rational straight lines commensurable in square only; therefore EK is a binomial straight line, divided at H. [[X. 36](/principles/euclid-10-36)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"两者均为有理;因此,EH,HK,有理线段,平方可公度而长度不可公度;因此,EK是二项无理线段直线,分为H。 [[X. 36](/principles/euclid-10-36)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-71.proof.10","contentId":"euclid-10-71","revisionId":"euclid-10-71@raw-ba8ecb9e6afbe458","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 10","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"be6ac55f94aa4133634e61948345371c987d7f25013c0101abf609c7edf6e32d","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since AB is greater than CD, while AB is equal to EG and CD to HI, therefore EG is also greater than HI; therefore EH is also greater than HK."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由于AB超过CD,AB等于EG,CD等于HI,因此EG也大于HI,因此EH也大于HK。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-71.proof.11","contentId":"euclid-10-71","revisionId":"euclid-10-71@raw-ba8ecb9e6afbe458","order":12,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 11","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"cf4eeaebae9f83744049549dff7c9bd9975b48ebec1ed490987b0ef251bfd1f0","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"The square, then, on EH is greater than the square on HK either by the square on a straight line commensurable in length with EH or by the square on a straight line incommensurable with it."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"正方形,EH,比HK正方形高,或者比长度可公度直线正方形EH高,或者比正方形直线不可公度高。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-71.proof.12","contentId":"euclid-10-71","revisionId":"euclid-10-71@raw-ba8ecb9e6afbe458","order":13,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 12","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"77d557dc7f777f6fd8de6adf14b3919fb4a155cd0d46443c27e1ce23d583b9ea","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"First, let the square on it be greater by the square on a straight line commensurable with itself."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"首先,让正方形机在正方形机上 以可公度直线上 本身来放大"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-71.proof.13","contentId":"euclid-10-71","revisionId":"euclid-10-71@raw-ba8ecb9e6afbe458","order":14,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 13","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ccb0f0a949d625d2f018344da993d94d630b0e1af7cb44f1fb67459be6dfc4eb","citations":["euclid-10-def-5"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now the greater straight line HE is commensurable in length with the rational straight line EF set out; therefore EK is a first binomial. [[X. Deff. II. 1](/principles/euclid-10-def-5)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,较大的直线 HE为长度可公度,有理线段 EF线已经确定;因此,直线 EK是第二项无理线段。 [[X. Deff. II. 1](/principles/euclid-10-def-5)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-71.proof.14","contentId":"euclid-10-71","revisionId":"euclid-10-71@raw-ba8ecb9e6afbe458","order":15,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 14","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c792c9acff4a1293a15dcd51fac8cc0d4518aff2f8c02d0f0fcd2f7dbd26ba30","citations":["euclid-10-54"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But EF is rational; and, if an area be contained by a rational straight line and the first binomial, the side of the square equal to the area is binomial. [[X. 54](/principles/euclid-10-54)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但EF是有理;如果一个区域由有理线段和第一个二项无理线段组成,则正方形等于该区域的一侧为二项无理线段。 [[X. 54](/principles/euclid-10-54)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-71.proof.15","contentId":"euclid-10-71","revisionId":"euclid-10-71@raw-ba8ecb9e6afbe458","order":16,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 15","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e5c032d7392206f17a9b90abc34fb39336dce2fb328fd0191551bb37c8ecbd9e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the side of EI is binomial; so that the side of AD is also binomial."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,EI是二项无理线段;AD也是二项无理线段。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-71.proof.16","contentId":"euclid-10-71","revisionId":"euclid-10-71@raw-ba8ecb9e6afbe458","order":17,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 16","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"cc4ae4b4d1194ae9ad17044387fa8f81f0e053f4753dd810fa27c233d4c69bd6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Next, let the square on EH be greater than the square on HK by the square on a straight line incommensurable with EH."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"接下来,EH的正方形比HK的正方形 还要高,正方形直线不可公度,EH直线不可公度。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-71.proof.17","contentId":"euclid-10-71","revisionId":"euclid-10-71@raw-ba8ecb9e6afbe458","order":18,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 17","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"acc788c0f255eb718a46de3b0c46b8959e5731d5b8060b6f23decfcc7ea45daa","citations":["euclid-10-def-8"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now the greater straight line EH is commensurable in length with the rational straight line EF set out; therefore EK is a fourth binomial. [[X. Deff. II. 4](/principles/euclid-10-def-8)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,较大的直线 EH为长度可公度,有理线段 EF线已经确定;因此,第4 二项无理线段直线为EK。 [[X. Deff. II. 4](/principles/euclid-10-def-8)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-71.proof.18","contentId":"euclid-10-71","revisionId":"euclid-10-71@raw-ba8ecb9e6afbe458","order":19,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 18","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a0f4e72d073c69c5fe145cfed4819c5ea69fd1a71a4002df8b3ad2da549ee02d","citations":["euclid-10-57"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But EF is rational; and, if an area be contained by a rational straight line and the fourth binomial, the side of the area is the irrational straight line called major. [[X. 57](/principles/euclid-10-57)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,EF是有理;如果一个区域由有理线段和4 二项无理线段组成,则该区域的另一边是无理线段称为主要区域。 [[X. 57](/principles/euclid-10-57)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-71.proof.19","contentId":"euclid-10-71","revisionId":"euclid-10-71@raw-ba8ecb9e6afbe458","order":20,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 19","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1f180f6fc7e99e747189a8f321cac55916e4d06ef1f976dda5e617d3e7bfdee9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the side of the area EI is major; so that the side of the area AD is also major."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,EI区是主要地区;AD区也是主要地区。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-71.proof.20","contentId":"euclid-10-71","revisionId":"euclid-10-71@raw-ba8ecb9e6afbe458","order":21,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 20","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a34a7d5be8655c2fde60e42b1e7156acdd5d8a26eddb48150d7ba47436cba7ea","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Next, let AB be less than CD; therefore EG is also less than HI, so that EH is also less than HK."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"其次,AB应少于CD;因此,EG也应少于HI,EH应少于HK。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-71.proof.21","contentId":"euclid-10-71","revisionId":"euclid-10-71@raw-ba8ecb9e6afbe458","order":22,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 21","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a4a69767c09af5aec44b6a7e37ea4fd954f7c2dac9000b0dd08e2dce5d7a2d96","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now the square on HK is greater than the square on EH either by the square on a straight line commensurable with HK or by the square on a straight line incommensurable with it."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,HK的正方形比EH的正方形要高,或者比可公度直线正方形HK直线可公度高,或者比正方形直线不可公度高。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-71.proof.22","contentId":"euclid-10-71","revisionId":"euclid-10-71@raw-ba8ecb9e6afbe458","order":23,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 22","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"211b438900f31450b5162ed6eaa433e73e4ad6ae6778e0e387c688314014d464","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"First, let the square on it be greater by the square on a straight line commensurable in length with itself."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"首先,让正方形机在正方形机上 以长度可公度直线上 本身来放大"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-71.proof.23","contentId":"euclid-10-71","revisionId":"euclid-10-71@raw-ba8ecb9e6afbe458","order":24,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 23","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"81e509217fbbe05fa7f711e0a794087c33709ac2032887c044c4649db552746e","citations":["euclid-10-def-6"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now the lesser straight line EH is commensurable in length with the rational straight line EF set out; therefore EK is a second binomial. [[X. Deff. II. 2](/principles/euclid-10-def-6)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,较小的直线 EH是长度可公度,有理线段 EF线已经确定;因此,EK是第二条二项无理线段。 [[X. Deff. II. 2](/principles/euclid-10-def-6)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-71.proof.24","contentId":"euclid-10-71","revisionId":"euclid-10-71@raw-ba8ecb9e6afbe458","order":25,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 24","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d576c2bfb984d55e7668820284fb2366ec11bb75e5ca061f1e90f22e4e20232a","citations":["euclid-10-55"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But EF is rational, and, if an area be contained by a rational straight line and the second binomial, the side of the square equal to it is a first bimedial; [[X. 55](/principles/euclid-10-55)] therefore the side of the area EI is a first bimedial, so that the side of AD is also a first bimedial."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但EF是有理,如果一个区域由有理线段和第二个二项无理线段组成,正方形等于它的一方是双中项无理线段;因此,EI区域的一方是双中项无理线段,AD的一方也是第一个双中项无理线段。 [[X. 55](/principles/euclid-10-55)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-71.proof.25","contentId":"euclid-10-71","revisionId":"euclid-10-71@raw-ba8ecb9e6afbe458","order":26,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 25","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"fda9c0f06557f19bdfb7f8c1c57df1b60d512a1051aa567ca8200fdcdf221c46","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Next, let the square on HK be greater than the square on HE by the square on a straight line incommensurable with HK."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"接下来,HK的正方形比HE的正方形 还要高,正方形直线不可公度,HK直线不可公度。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-71.proof.26","contentId":"euclid-10-71","revisionId":"euclid-10-71@raw-ba8ecb9e6afbe458","order":27,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 26","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3a775ec1e5a3fc5caa905255fc125ed127be702b5ff41a4905cdbfb5308dcf30","citations":["euclid-10-def-9"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now the lesser straight line EH is commensurable with the rational straight line EF set out; therefore EK is a fifth binomial. [[X. Deff. II. 5](/principles/euclid-10-def-9)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,较小的直线 EH是可公度,有理线段 EF线已经确定;因此,第5条直线是EK。 [[X. Deff. II. 5](/principles/euclid-10-def-9)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-71.proof.27","contentId":"euclid-10-71","revisionId":"euclid-10-71@raw-ba8ecb9e6afbe458","order":28,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 27","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7b4a8dff3ebdf79d57df4718f422e7b3419257f72e18887005a1a03f33cd9e59","citations":["euclid-10-58"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But EF is rational; and, if an area be contained by a rational straight line and the fifth binomial, the side of the square equal to the area is a side of a rational plus a medial area. [[X. 58](/principles/euclid-10-58)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,EF是有理;如果一个区域由有理线段和第五二项无理线段组成,则正方形等于该区域的一面是有理加中项无理线段区域的一面。 [[X. 58](/principles/euclid-10-58)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-71.proof.28","contentId":"euclid-10-71","revisionId":"euclid-10-71@raw-ba8ecb9e6afbe458","order":29,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 28","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b717cc77d4a91d04356daad7cfcbddd8ef6e302a6797d0304102bf6311950350","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the side of the area EI is a side of a rational plus a medial area, so that the side of the area AD is also a side of a rational plus a medial area."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,EI区的一侧是有理加中项无理线段区的一面,因此,AD区的一侧也是有理加中项无理线段区的一面。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-71.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-10-71","revisionId":"euclid-10-71@raw-ba8ecb9e6afbe458","order":30,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d41f4fe56dd428c759377c807a93013dffbbe29c7596acfdac57dd182cad51b6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore etc. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,等等,证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-71.source","contentId":"euclid-10-71","revisionId":"euclid-10-71@raw-ba8ecb9e6afbe458","order":31,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5e4bb97e270caa5a933201739904fd73ba9dc72604fd1341c8ddc98dcf5e31c6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.71/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.pr